RozeLynx pam-passkeys: runtime switch for the PAM platform authenticator.

security.webauthn.rozelynx_pam.enabled (default true) turns the local
passkey authenticator off without a rebuild; with it off the service
degrades to a transparent pass-through to the authrs_bridge and
isUVPAA answers false again. The authenticator itself is only compiled in
GTK builds with USE=pam-passkeys.

--- a/modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml
+++ b/modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml
@@ -18984,6 +18984,13 @@
   mirror: always
   rust: true
 
+# RozeLynx: local platform authenticator backed by PAM (howdy face
+# authentication, account password fallback). GTK builds only.
+- name: security.webauthn.rozelynx_pam.enabled
+  type: RelaxedAtomicBool
+  value: true
+  mirror: always
+
 # residentKey support when using Android platform API
 - name: security.webauthn.webauthn_enable_android_fido2.residentkey
   type: RelaxedAtomicBool
